Output scene-buy.mp4
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1280
Set Height 720
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Padding 24
Hide
Type "cd /repo/packages/mcp-buyer && export NO_COLOR=" Enter
Type "clear" Enter
Show
Sleep 1s
Type "node buy-live.mjs   # real money, real store, mainnet"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 40s
Sleep 5s
